WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.368
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.368 --> 00:00:03.769
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.769 --> 00:00:05.704
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.704 --> 00:00:08.841
After meeting with Russian
President Vladimir Putin

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.777
on Tuesday, President Biden
said yesterday that he was,

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:14.681
"Straightforward but polite"
with Putin,

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.982
and Putin was "as warm as ever."

00:00:16.982 --> 00:00:17.917
Ohh!

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:19.652
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.520
[ Breathes deeply ]

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.255
During a radio interview
yesterday,

00:00:23.255 --> 00:00:25.958
former President Trump
referred to President Biden's

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:29.829
Build Back Better plan as,
"Build Back Worse,"

00:00:29.829 --> 00:00:32.131
in case you were wondering
what he's been working on

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.666
these past 11 months.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:36.235
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:37.737
[ As Trump ]
"Build Back Better"...

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.940
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.475
"Oh, my --
I think I got it."

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:45.145
[ Laughter ]
Mel?!

00:00:45.145 --> 00:00:49.549
Mel!"

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:52.652
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.652 --> 00:00:55.321
President Biden spoke today
with Ukrainian president

00:00:55.321 --> 00:00:57.990
Volodymyr Zelensky
amid a Russian military buildup

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.626
on the Ukraine border
and informed him that while he

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:04.197
cannot send troops,
he will send a little support.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:06.833
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:10.003
In his new book, ex-White House
chief of staff Mark Meadows

00:01:10.003 --> 00:01:12.738
writes that former president
Trump was mortified

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:14.407
after the Capitol attack

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.142
and worried
about his media coverage.

00:01:16.142 --> 00:01:18.711
Was he mortified?
Donald Trump?

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.280
That guy can't be embarrassed.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:22.181
He wasn't embarrassed
after this, or...

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:23.416
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:25.919
Or after this.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.687
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.687 --> 00:01:29.455
Or even after this.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:31.924
[ Laughter ]
This is the same guy

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:36.863
who thought Tim Cook's name
was "Tim Apple"

00:01:36.863 --> 00:01:38.297
because he worked for Apple.

00:01:38.297 --> 00:01:39.965
If you don't step down
after that,

00:01:39.965 --> 00:01:41.334
you're just not someone
who gets embarrassed.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.336
Actually, you know what?
I haven't seen that in a minute.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:45.605
Can we throw it up?
-I mean, you've really

00:01:45.605 --> 00:01:47.140
put a big investment
in our country.

00:01:47.140 --> 00:01:49.275
We appreciate it very much,
Tim Apple.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:54.647
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.647 --> 00:01:58.017
-A Las Vegas money manager
is reportedly proposing plans

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.952
to build a casino
in New York City,

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:02.421
or if you really
want to gamble in New York City,

00:02:02.421 --> 00:02:04.223
touch a subway pole.

00:02:04.223 --> 00:02:06.692
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.692 --> 00:02:09.561
The head of Instagram testified
yesterday before Congress

00:02:09.561 --> 00:02:11.230
but only after an hour

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.599
of explaining what it was
to Chuck Grassley.

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.534
[ As Chuck Grassley ]
"Do you -- Do you have to have

00:02:15.534 --> 00:02:17.971
one of them cordless phone
for it?"

00:02:17.971 --> 00:02:19.605
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.605 --> 00:02:22.074
The makers of Miller Lite
recently began offering

00:02:22.074 --> 00:02:23.709
drinkable Christmas ornaments.

00:02:23.709 --> 00:02:26.779
Oh, they're drinkable?
What's inside them, Heineken?

00:02:26.779 --> 00:02:30.583
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.583 --> 00:02:33.886
And finally --
And finally, Google released

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:37.356
its annual so-called
"Year in Search" list yesterday,

00:02:37.356 --> 00:02:40.426
and the second-most searched
"how to be" phrase was

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:43.463
"how to be more attractive,"
whereas the third-most searched

00:02:43.463 --> 00:02:45.531
was "how to be happy alone."

00:02:45.531 --> 00:02:50.303
And it's kind of fun to see
people give up in real time.

00:02:50.303 --> 00:02:51.737
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.737 --> 00:02:55.241
"'How to be more attractive.'
Oh, a lot of steps."

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:57.977
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.977 --> 00:03:00.880
That was a monologue, everybody.
Oh, man, oh, man.

